      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Public-only is a real, narrower instance",
      "items": [
        "FromPublicKey imports only the PKCS#1 public key blob",
        "PrivateKey is null on this instance; PublicKey is always available",
        "Deploy it on the side that only sends or verifies"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "A full key pair does everything",
      "items": [
        "new RsaEncryption() or new RsaEncryption(privateKeyBase64) can Encrypt, Decrypt, Sign, and Verify",
        "Decrypt uses OAEP-SHA256 padding; Sign uses SHA-256 with PKCS#1 v1.5",
        "Keys export as raw PKCS#1 DER in Base64, not PEM"
      ]
